    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεροπ-ηγερέτα</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στεροπηγερέτης</span>,
		either (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγείρω</span>, so <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστεροπαγερέτας,
		νεφεληγερέτα</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>he
				who gathers the lightning</i>, or (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγείρω</span>), <i>who rouses the lightning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.298
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				8.370
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς -έταο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.164
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span> in nom., except
			by position.]</div>
